#### Function for making a table
```{r}
display_table <- function(file_name){
  f <- fread(file_name)
  f <- f %>% 
  dplyr::select(-c("sumlogReal","var(Perms)","mean(Perms)", "nSNP"))
  
  f
}
```

Load matched, random sets for WNT
```{r}

display_table("../1000perm.wnt.il6.jag.merged.P1.empp") %>% kable()

```

load matched, random sets for IL6 
